---
import catalog from '../../../data/martin/index.mjs';

const unit = catalog.parts[3].units[1];
const anchorFor = (sectionId) => `#section-${sectionId.replace('.', '-')}`;
---

<section id="source-map" class="chapter-source-map" aria-labelledby="chapter13-source-map-title">
  <h2 id="chapter13-source-map-title">来源地图 | Source Map</h2>
  <p>
    下表只记录目录级定位和网站覆盖状态，不转录教材正文。页码为 Martin 第 2 版印刷页码。
    <span lang="en">The table records directory-level locators and website coverage only; it does not reproduce textbook prose. Page numbers refer to the printed second edition.</span>
  </p>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>节 | Section</th>
        <th>Martin 标题 | Martin title</th>
        <th>印刷页 | Printed page</th>
        <th>网站位置 | Site position</th>
        <th>状态 | Status</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {unit.sections.map((section) => (
        <tr>
          <td>{section.id}</td>
          <td lang="en">{section.title}</td>
          <td>{section.page}</td>
          <td><a href={anchorFor(section.id)}>本页对应段落 | matching section</a></td>
          <td>正文编写中 | body in progress</td>
        </tr>
      ))}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <p class="chapter-source-map__supplement">
    <strong>补充定位：</strong>Chapter 7（Kohn–Sham 总能与自洽），145–168；Chapter 11（赝势与 PAW），230–256；Chapter 12（平面波与网格表示），262–280；Appendix F，607–619；Appendix G，620–626；Appendix M，661–676。Sholl–Steckel Chapters 2、4、10 只用于周期固体、slab/vacuum 和精度检查的实践连接。
  </p>
  <p class="chapter-source-map__supplement" lang="en">
    <strong>Supplemental locators:</strong> Chapter 7 on Kohn–Sham energy and self-consistency, pp. 145–168; Chapter 11 on pseudopotentials and PAW, pp. 230–256; Chapter 12 on plane-wave and grid representations, pp. 262–280; Appendix F, pp. 607–619; Appendix G, pp. 620–626; Appendix M, pp. 661–676. Sholl–Steckel Chapters 2, 4, and 10 are used only for practical links to periodic solids, slab/vacuum models, and accuracy checks.
  </p>
</section>

<style>
  .chapter-source-map__supplement {
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
    border-left: 0.25rem solid var(--sl-color-accent);
    padding: 0.65rem 0.8rem;
    background: var(--sl-color-gray-6);
  }
</style>
